 "sustained": false,
 "notes": "Rhodes Mark I Stage 73 (1977), one velocity layer (the GM bank uses jRhodes layer 3 up to F4 and layer 4 from B4 up), 15 notes F1-C7 sampled every 4-6 semitones (fourths), so the engine pitch-shifts up to +-3 semitones. The GM-bank files are shortened at their sustain loop; the tails of short upper notes were continued through the author's own loop with a matched exponential decay, so every file is a self-contained one-shot (no loop points needed). Add tremolo/chorus in the engine if wanted. Recommended release 0.3-0.4 s.",
 "sampleRate": 44100
